<title>BRAZIL: Brazil non-ferrous metals - December statistics.</title>
<headline>Brazil non-ferrous metals - December statistics.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Production in December 1996 and consumption, imports and exports of Brazilian non-ferrous metals in 1996 compared with 1995 were as follows, said the Secretariat of Mines and Metallurgy.</p>
<p>All figures are in tonnes.</p>
<p>    METAL	     PRODUCTION (DEC)    CONSUMPTION (JAN/DEC)</p>
<p>			   1996	 1995	    1996	 1995</p>
<p> Aluminium	  101,000    102,000	 677,426    500,300</p>
<p> Lead			 0	    0	     n/a     61,683</p>
<p> Copper		11,345     13,564	 233,111    197,613</p>
<p> Tin		    1,740	1,252	   6,157	5,579</p>
<p> Magnesium		n/a	  n/a	     n/a	  n/a</p>
<p> Nickel		 1,437	1,362	  19,148     18,935</p>
<p> Zinc		  14,874     15,375	 131,698    179,670</p>
<p> METAL		   EXPORTS (JAN/DEC)	IMPORTS (JAN/DEC)</p>
<p>			   1996	 1995	    1996	 1995</p>
<p> Aluminium	  631,851    803,654	  89,357    101,818</p>
<p> Lead		   1,549	3,251	  38,395     47,780</p>
<p> Copper		62,256     74,019	 156,979    160,267</p>
<p> Tin		   12,289     10,190		74	  175</p>
<p> Magnesium	    1,361	  760	   3,159	3,130</p>
<p> Nickel		 5,762	4,577	   8,914	8,013</p>
<p> Zinc		  53,575     53,095	   5,957     39,104</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
</text>
